---

<section
  id="about"
  class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-[var(--spacing-section)] md:px-10"
>
  <p class="eyebrow mb-8" data-reveal>About</p>
  <h2 class="sr-only">About me</h2>
  <p
    class="font-display text-section max-w-4xl leading-[1.18] font-medium tracking-[-0.025em]"
    data-word-scrub
  >
    I care about the gap between how a system works and how a person feels using
    it. Most of my work is about closing that gap through better structure,
    clearer interfaces, and products that respect the people they serve.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-12">
    <div class="border-border border-t pt-6" data-reveal>
      <h3 class="font-display mb-3 text-lg font-medium">Systems thinking</h3>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        I approach problems from the data, the flow, and the user outward
        - not from the screen inward.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="border-border border-t pt-6"
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.1"
    >
      <h3 class="font-display mb-3 text-lg font-medium">Design + build</h3>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        I like to take an idea from rough concept through interface to shipped,
        working product.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="border-border border-t pt-6"
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="0.2"
    >
      <h3 class="font-display mb-3 text-lg font-medium">Always learning</h3>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Currently exploring how modern web tooling and thoughtful motion can
        feel fast and natural.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
